{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "DFSM Python FastAPI Order & Fulfillment API (eklabdev-dfsm)",
    "description": "End-to-end Postman Collection for stepping through the DFSM Python FastAPI REST API Server (`examples/06-fastapi-api-server`).\n\n### Changing the Order ID (`{{orderId}}`)\nYou can change the active order ID in **any** of three ways:\n1. **Collection Variables tab**: Edit `orderId` (default `order-py-101`) — every request automatically uses `{{orderId}}`.\n2. **Request Body of `01a. Create Order`**: Change `\"orderId\"` in JSON; Post-response script updates `{{orderId}}` to match.\n3. **One-click Auto-Generator (`01b. Create Order — Auto-New orderId`)**: Generates a fresh `order-<timestamp>` and stores it in `{{orderId}}`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "orderId",
      "value": "order-py-101",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "customerEmail",
      "value": "buyer@eklab.dev",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Happy Path — Step-by-Step Transitions (1-by-1)",
      "description": "Walks a single `{{orderId}}` through `created` -> `inventory_reserved` -> parallel `fulfilling` -> automatic `onDone` -> `delivered` (`COMPLETED`).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "00. Get Machine Definition & YAML",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/machine",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "machine"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "01a. Create Order (Uses / Updates {{orderId}})",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Created order transaction (200)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data && data.order_id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', data.order_id);",
                  "    console.log('Active {{orderId}} set to:', data.order_id, '| currentState:', data.current_state, '| status:', data.status, '| availableEvents:', data.available_events);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orderId\": \"{{orderId}}\",\n  \"customer\": \"{{customerEmail}}\",\n  \"amount\": 150.0,\n  \"autoAuthorize\": false,\n  \"simulateFailure\": false\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "01b. Create Order (Auto-New orderId)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const newId = 'order-py-' + Date.now();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', newId);",
                  "console.log('Generated fresh orderId:', newId);"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Created order transaction (200)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data && data.order_id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', data.order_id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orderId\": \"{{orderId}}\",\n  \"customer\": \"{{customerEmail}}\",\n  \"amount\": 150.0,\n  \"autoAuthorize\": false,\n  \"simulateFailure\": false\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "02. Submit Order (SUBMIT_ORDER)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event\": \"SUBMIT_ORDER\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/transitions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders", "{{orderId}}", "transitions"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "03. Authorize Payment (AUTHORIZE_PAYMENT)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event\": \"AUTHORIZE_PAYMENT\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/transitions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders", "{{orderId}}", "transitions"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "04. Complete Packing (PACK_COMPLETE)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event\": \"PACK_COMPLETE\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/transitions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders", "{{orderId}}", "transitions"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "05. Book Carrier (BOOK_CARRIER -> onDone -> delivered)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event\": \"BOOK_CARRIER\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/transitions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders", "{{orderId}}", "transitions"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "06. Inspect Order State",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders", "{{orderId}}"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Saga Compensation Rollback & Error Recovery",
      "description": "Demonstrates automatic LIFO Saga compensation unwind when a step fails after retries.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01. Create Order Configured to Fail Payment",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const failId = 'order-fail-' + Date.now();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', failId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orderId\": \"{{orderId}}\",\n  \"customer\": \"fail@eklab.dev\",\n  \"amount\": 250.0,\n  \"autoAuthorize\": false,\n  \"simulateFailure\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "02. Reserve Inventory (Pushes Compensation Step)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event\": \"SUBMIT_ORDER\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/transitions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders", "{{orderId}}", "transitions"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "03. Authorize Payment (Fails -> 3 Retries -> Unwinds releaseInventory)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event\": \"AUTHORIZE_PAYMENT\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/transitions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders", "{{orderId}}", "transitions"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "04. Reset Order from Error Back to Created",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/reset",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders", "{{orderId}}", "reset"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Validation & Guardrail Responses (422 / 404 / 409)",
      "description": "Verifies robust API error reporting for malformed JSON, invalid transitions, and missing orders.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01. Reject Invalid Email (422)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orderId\": \"order-bad-email\",\n  \"customer\": \"not-a-valid-email\",\n  \"amount\": 100.0\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "02. Reject Non-Positive Amount (422)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orderId\": \"order-bad-amt\",\n  \"customer\": \"buyer@eklab.dev\",\n  \"amount\": -20.0\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "03. Non-Existent Order (404)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/order-non-existent-9999",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders", "order-non-existent-9999"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "04. Invalid Transition Event (409 Conflict)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event\": \"INVALID_EVENT_FROM_CURRENT_STATE\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/transitions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders", "{{orderId}}", "transitions"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Machine YAML & Admin Control Plane",
      "description": "Inspect machine definitions, query in-flight transactions, check scheduler status, and sweep stuck transactions.",
      "item": [
